  ],
  [
    "Block",
    {
      "type_": "variable",
      "labels": [ [ "Lit", "interfaces" ] ],
      "body": [
        [
          "Attribute",
          "description",
          [
            "Heredoc",
            [
              "EOF",
              "\nList of the network interfaces specifications.\n\n**Note!** \\\nThe ORDER in which you specify the interfaces DOES MATTER.\n\nInterfaces will be attached to VM in the order you define here, therefore:\n\n- the first should be the management interface, which does not participate in data filtering\n- the remaining ones are the dataplane interfaces.\n  \nFollowing configuration options are available:\n\n- `name`                           - (`string`, required) the interface name.\n- `subnet_id`                      - (`string`, required) ID of an existing subnet to create the interface in.\n- `ip_configurations`              - (`map`, required) A map that contains the IP configurations for the interface.\n  - `name`                           - (`string`, optional, defaults to `primary`) the name of the interface IP configuration.\n  - `primary`                        - (`bool`, optional, defaults to `true`) sets the current IP configuration as the primary\n                                       one.\n  - `create_public_ip`               - (`bool`, optional, defaults to `false`) if `true`, create a public IP for the interface.\n  - `pip_domain_name_label`          - (`string`, optional, defaults to `null`) the Prefix which should be used for the Domain\n                                       Name Label for each Virtual Machine Instance.\n  - `pip_idle_timeout_in_minutes`    - (`number`, optional, defaults to Azure default) the Idle Timeout in minutes for the \n                                       Public IP Address, possible values are in the range from 4 to 32.\n  - `pip_prefix_name`                - (`string`, optional) the name of an existing Public IP Address Prefix from where Public\n                                       IP Addresses should be allocated.\n  - `pip_prefix_resource_group_name` - (`string`, optional, defaults to the VMSS's RG) name of a Resource Group hosting an \n                                       existing Public IP Prefix resource.\n  - `pip_prefix_id`                  - (`string`, optional) you can specify Public IP Prefix ID as an alternative to the\n                                       properties above (name and resource group), in case you want to avoid using a data\n                                       source block.\n- `lb_backend_pool_ids`            - (`list`, optional, defaults to `[]`) a list of identifiers of existing Load Balancer\n                                     backend pools to associate the interface with. Only applied to primary IP configuration.\n- `appgw_backend_pool_ids`         - (`list`, optional, defaults to `[]`) a list of identifier of Application Gateway's backend\n                                     pools to associate the interface with. Only applied to primary IP configuration.\n\nExample:\n\n```hcl\n[\n  {\n    name       = \"management\"\n    subnet_id  = azurerm_subnet.my_mgmt_subnet.id\n    ip_configurations = {\n        primary-ip = {\n          name             = \"primary-ip\"\n          primary          = true\n          create_public_ip = true\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name      = \"private\"\n    subnet_id = azurerm_subnet.my_priv_subnet.id\n    ip_configurations = {\n        primary-ip = {\n          name             = \"primary-ip\"\n          primary          = true\n          create_public_ip = false\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name                = \"public\"\n    subnet_id           = azurerm_subnet.my_pub_subnet.id\n    lb_backend_pool_ids = [azurerm_lb_backend_address_pool.lb_backend.id]\n    ip_configurations = {\n        primary-ip = {\n          name             = \"primary-ip\"\n          primary          = true\n          create_public_ip = true\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "Attribute",
          "type",
          [
            "Fun_call",
            [
              "list",
              [
                [
                  "Fun_call",
                  [
                    "object",
                    [
                      [
                        "Object",
                        [
                          [ [ "Bare", "name" ], [ "Id", "string" ] ],
                          [ [ "Bare", "subnet_id" ], [ "Id", "string" ] ],
                          [
                            [ "Bare", "ip_configurations" ],
                            [
                              "Fun_call",
                              [
                                "map",
                                [
                                  [
                                    "Fun_call",
                                    [
                                      "object",
                                      [
                                        [
                                          "Object",
                                          [
                                            [
                                              [ "Bare", "name" ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [
                                                    [ "Id", "string" ],
                                                    [ "String", "primary" ]
                                                  ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ],
                                            [
                                              [ "Bare", "primary" ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [
                                                    [ "Id", "bool" ],
                                                    [ "Bool", true ]
                                                  ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ],
                                            [
                                              [ "Bare", "create_public_ip" ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [
                                                    [ "Id", "bool" ],
                                                    [ "Bool", false ]
                                                  ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ],
                                            [
                                              [
                                                "Bare",
                                                "pip_domain_name_label"
                                              ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [ [ "Id", "string" ] ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ],
                                            [
                                              [
                                                "Bare",
                                                "pip_idle_timeout_in_minutes"
                                              ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [ [ "Id", "number" ] ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ],
                                            [
                                              [ "Bare", "pip_prefix_name" ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [ [ "Id", "string" ] ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ],
                                            [
                                              [
                                                "Bare",
                                                "pip_prefix_resource_group_name"
                                              ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [ [ "Id", "string" ] ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ],
                                            [
                                              [ "Bare", "pip_prefix_id" ],
                                              [
                                                "Fun_call",
                                                [
                                                  "optional",
                                                  [ [ "Id", "string" ] ]
                                                ]
                                              ]
                                            ]
                                          ]
                                        ]
                                      ]
                                    ]
                                  ]
                                ]
                              ]
                            ]
                          ],
                          [
                            [ "Bare", "lb_backend_pool_ids" ],
                            [
                              "Fun_call",
                              [
                                "optional",
                                [
                                  [
                                    "Fun_call",
                                    [ "list", [ [ "Id", "string" ] ] ]
                                  ],
                                  [ "Tuple", [] ]
                                ]
                              ]
                            ]
                          ],
                          [
                            [ "Bare", "appgw_backend_pool_ids" ],
                            [
                              "Fun_call",
                              [
                                "optional",
                                [
                                  [
                                    "Fun_call",
                                    [ "list", [ [ "Id", "string" ] ] ]
                                  ],
                                  [ "Tuple", [] ]
                                ]
                              ]
                            ]
                          ]
                        ]
                      ]
                    ]
                  ]
                ]
              ]
            ]
          ]
        ],
